{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05907","headline":"偶然作六首 二 · 王维","name":"偶然作六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田舍有老翁，垂白衡门里。\n有时农事闲，斗酒呼邻里。\n喧聒茅檐下，或坐或复起。\n短褐不爲薄，园葵固足美。\n动则长子孙，不曾向城市。\n五帝与三王，古来称天子。\n干戈将揖让，毕竟何者是。\n得意苟爲乐，野田安足鄙。\n且当放怀去，行行没余齿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}